{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the leader of a new Kingdom, starting from nothing and hoping to reach the highest levels of Prosperity. Each turn, play Cards to add Citizens, Constructions, Animals, and Soldiers to your Kingdom, building a city that can produce vast amounts of resources and protect itself from disease, invaders, and other challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/08a51c02aed9620097a35470a0b50392.avif?t=1770266401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras_big/08a51c02aed9620097a35470a0b50392.avif?t=1770266401 width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Kingdom is all about trying to create synergies, placing Citizens near each other to generate resources and activate abilities. As your city grows, you will need to rearrange things and decide what must be kept, and what must be removed to make way for new additions. Do you keep your Cobbler near the Farmers to increase your Food, or is it time to shift it over to boosting the Miners for Labor? Or perhaps we could remove the Cobbler and put in a Cook instead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/7b1baa3c41ad6657361b7dc892121cc8.poster.avif?t=1770266401\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/7b1baa3c41ad6657361b7dc892121cc8.webm?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/7b1baa3c41ad6657361b7dc892121cc8.mp4?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/73961557281cf4632bad3d9fb33ac5d1.avif?t=1770266401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras_big/73961557281cf4632bad3d9fb33ac5d1.avif?t=1770266401 width=800 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges will emerge from nature, hostile nations, and the fabric of magic itself. While you are trying to grow your Kingdom, you must also find ways to protect it from disease, criminals, invaders, and more. New challenges are always emerging, and always growing stronger\u2014 so your Kingdom must always be growing stronger as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/dd20366511cefe9606871b6985a3851a.poster.avif?t=1770266401\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/dd20366511cefe9606871b6985a3851a.webm?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/dd20366511cefe9606871b6985a3851a.mp4?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/b9a83513066c999a06c2e1b3ad9665f0.avif?t=1770266401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras_big/b9a83513066c999a06c2e1b3ad9665f0.avif?t=1770266401 width=800 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of your resources reset every turn. This means that if you can't afford to build a Construction you want, you can't just sit around and wait\u2014 you need to figure out what must change in your Kingdom to reach the levels of resources required. Reach new levels of production by carefully arranging Citizens to activate synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/9c4589e2f4beb0f8fe07225cb0b6e0bb.poster.avif?t=1770266401\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/9c4589e2f4beb0f8fe07225cb0b6e0bb.webm?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/9c4589e2f4beb0f8fe07225cb0b6e0bb.mp4?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/4dd93eb4c76d1f61d1ab834d341096a2.avif?t=1770266401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras_big/4dd93eb4c76d1f61d1ab834d341096a2.avif?t=1770266401 width=800 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you ascend through the Tiers of Prosperity, you will be continually unlocking new Cards to add to your Kingdom, discovering new resources, abilities, and synergies. Will the older Citizens be valuable building blocks to combine with your newer members, or should some of them be removed to make way for new abilities?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At higher Tiers, unlock new mechanics to provide for your Kingdom. Launch Invasions to secure more resources, craft Laws to reshape your Kingdom, and manage a Court of Councilors with shifting loyalties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/7ece9cd2abb06c8109208c199ed2772a.poster.avif?t=1770266401\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/7ece9cd2abb06c8109208c199ed2772a.webm?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/7ece9cd2abb06c8109208c199ed2772a.mp4?t=1770266401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/extras/0032631653cefe028e5ce5d4bf3a68e4.avif?t=1770266401\" width=1300 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your victories, you will unlock new ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos Modifiers reshape the entire fabric of the game, changing the way your Kingdom will be built on future playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alt Cards let you flip cards between two different versions, giving you more flexibility to try new strategies.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tier 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/fa9c203fb8f8b24ba8c7fd776a89952b6e9e1cd9.jpg"},{"name":"Tier 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/37cab98e2f807f685c391e5893b8f362ac3f4360.jpg"},{"name":"Tier 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/20e2e300321e321f51b88101a25f531ad35b4d63.jpg"},{"name":"Tier 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/03e6ec9143e1d11d8f93a55be90d4be4b83c53fe.jpg"},{"name":"An Enduring Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/0a71e74f3fa73d9ffb20a19fbed08ff08ff83105.jpg"},{"name":"A Strong Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/1d9397cd0d56c5c7591d34d98a7f26e2621b4c61.jpg"},{"name":"The Strongest Kingdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/2a14dfebeedc7205098122af3e1497b18e1c5b38.jpg"},{"name":"Crowded","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/2ac25dbde2be83da6fde1f0c10eb841995579ecf.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Packed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/e35df784e35aad8a6334162079f53909f0fcd45e.jpg"},{"name":"Big 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3427940/a75691f51d6a0cb2c07036817b6abf3b85e8e2e8.jpg"}],"total":42},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427940?t=1770266401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770266401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/c0a30c84faa48a506345f8c0e9f07ef717402e2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770266401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427940/c0a30c84faa48a506345f8c0e9f07ef717402e2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770266401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3553450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the leader of a new Kingdom, starting from nothing and hop